Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to Qiqi Meets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the Little Prince~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the little prince and the fox
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,became good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The fox said taming means building ties,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and it takes heart
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the little prince has something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.69,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,very hard to tell Qiqi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going back to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,his star.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The desert was very
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,quiet at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince sat on a sand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,dune,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.05,0:00:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,looking at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Little prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking at my star.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi, I have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back? Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,To where I came from—that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,tiny little star.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:00:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't you just make
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,friends with the fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But my rose is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She only has four thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone could hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,calling me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.09,0:01:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi, look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,pointed at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many stars
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,up there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When you miss me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.95,0:01:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just look up at
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on that star,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,smiling at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll look at the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.31,0:01:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,stars every night!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi's eyes were a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,little red.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince gave
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,her a gentle hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi hugged him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,back tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.51,0:01:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,People who have tamed each
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,other never truly part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,me, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you do when
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:02:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you miss someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.07,0:02:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you look up at
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.13,0:02:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi will draw a rose for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the farthest star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,see you tomorrow~ ⭐
